 data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{DLO}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> 混淆。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"373da07803c26744\" href=\"?note=373da07803c26744\" title=\"57-df-godel-numbering\">57-df-godel-numbering</a> 的有效编码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> 取标准 Hilbert 演算下的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4107e891ce817208\" href=\"?note=4107e891ce817208\" title=\"57-df-decidable-theory\">57-df-decidable-theory</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DLO}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}}),\\qquad\\mathrm{DLO}\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DLO}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathrm{DLO}}),\\qquad\\mathrm{DLO}\\in\\mathrm{Dec}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure>","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-decidable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"4107e891ce817208","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-decidable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"140b30594fbd26d8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"targ